    kind: work_item  # 52a9
    title: "js_ts: the callback position lookup omits line_offset, so a .vue callback's calls are credited to the enclosing function while the same shape in .js/.ts is credited to the callback"  # 52a9
    status: todo_hard  # 52a9
    priority: 3  # 52a9
    parent:  # 52a9
    tags:  # 52a9
    - javascript  # 52a9
